//! The `fill` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines how SVG text
//! content and the interior canvas of SVG shapes are filled or painted. If present, it overrides the
//! element's `fill` attribute.
//!
//! Initial: black. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - none: No `fill` is painted; the areas inside the stroke, if any, are transparent.
//!
//! Grammar: <paint>
//!
//! Specification: https://w3c.github.io/svgwg/svg2-draft/painting.html#FillProperty
